#: d6d7533c08f44af1a099dd97ba1ed664 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy:1
msgid "Offload metric logging to a single background thread."
msgstr "Offload metric logging to a single background thread."

#: 5d4f94300d5e47fbb1af47d85592fade of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy:3
msgid ""
"Wraps any backend and forwards every ``log_*`` call via a one-worker "
"``ThreadPoolExecutor`` so network/disk I/O (SwanLab uploads, per-row CSV "
"flushes) never blocks the training thread. Mirrors the lifecycle of "
"``CheckpointManager``: submit-to-queue, ``flush`` drains tracked futures,"
" idempotent ``close`` registered with ``atexit``."
msgstr ""
"Wraps any backend and forwards every ``log_*`` call via a one-worker "
"``ThreadPoolExecutor`` so network/disk I/O (SwanLab uploads, per-row CSV "
"flushes) never blocks the training thread. Mirrors the lifecycle of "
"``CheckpointManager``: submit-to-queue, ``flush`` drains tracked futures,"
" idempotent ``close`` registered with ``atexit``."

#: 3d9af1e1e0c84ff79bd64692c851d5da of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy:9
msgid ""
"Not registered — wired directly by ``build_default_metric_loggers``, like"
" ``MetricLoggerComposite``."
msgstr ""
"Not registered — wired directly by ``build_default_metric_loggers``, like"
" ``MetricLoggerComposite``."

#: 7476cd5353004a588ba80b6b905249b9 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.close:1
msgid "Drain the queue and shut down the executor (atexit-only)."
msgstr "Drain the queue and shut down the executor (atexit-only)."

#: 91a8018dc7a74462a7a7adb81e5413f1 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.close:3
msgid ""
"Idempotent and fork-safe: skipped in child processes (the worker thread "
"does not survive ``fork``) and never raises."
msgstr ""
"Idempotent and fork-safe: skipped in child processes (the worker thread "
"does not survive ``fork``) and never raises."

#: 61933b928f6744fd970629d3f0a02101 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.finish:1
msgid "Drain pending logs, then finish the backend on the main thread."
msgstr "Drain pending logs, then finish the backend on the main thread."

#: 5261fabe91f84d3bbae8bc5f4694e8ec of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.finish:3
msgid ""
"``swanlab.finish`` restores its SIGINT handler via ``signal.signal`` "
"(main-thread-only) and blocks on upload confirmation that is only "
"interruptible via SIGINT — both require the main thread, so finish must "
"run here, not on the worker."
msgstr ""
"``swanlab.finish`` restores its SIGINT handler via ``signal.signal`` "
"(main-thread-only) and blocks on upload confirmation that is only "
"interruptible via SIGINT — both require the main thread, so finish must "
"run here, not on the worker."

#: fe123cd8bf164439ab1af2c0ff53cf22 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.flush:1
msgid "Wait for all pending log calls to finish, logging any exceptions."
msgstr "Wait for all pending log calls to finish, logging any exceptions."

#: 83227a800f7a4880b642cc934a0ba120 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.init_run:1
msgid "Initialize the wrapped backend synchronously."
msgstr "Initialize the wrapped backend synchronously."

#: 833daa51c18441a892d8c65accad0f59 of
#: utils.training.metric_logger.AsyncMetricLoggerProxy.init_run:3
msgid ""
"``swanlab.init`` is network I/O; a failure must surface immediately "
"rather than after a silent run. The composite's ``_fanout`` turns a non-"
"import failure here into a warning while other backends keep working; "
"``ImportError`` propagates (see ``_fanout``)."
msgstr ""
"``swanlab.init`` is network I/O; a failure must surface immediately "
"rather than after a silent run. The composite's ``_fanout`` turns a non-"
"import failure here into a warning while other backends keep working; "
"``ImportError`` propagates (see ``_fanout``)."

